    "long_instructions": "## Movie Admission\r\n\r\n1. Label each diamond with a condition.\r\n2. Add true/false labels to each branch and connect to four outcomes.\r\n3. Make sure each outcome matches what you'd expect from your truth table.\r\n4. Export your flowchart as a PNG for the next level.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n:::details [Example]\r\n*Drag out the instruction panel to enlarge the image.*\r\n![](https://images.code.org/6349c73de5cb831c6b52bf10b1f44fd2-image-1772823559934.png)\r\nTo save time, you can screenshot this image to use in the next code level. \r\n:::\r\n\r\n",
